# esbuild <=0.24.2 vulnerability (GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99) is present in Vite's
# bundled esbuild. This only affects the local dev server, not production builds.
# Fix requires Vite 8 which @vitejs/plugin-react does not yet support.
# Risk: zero — dev server is never exposed externally.
# Revisit when @vitejs/plugin-react supports Vite 8.
